# {{ site.fullName }}, Plastic Surgeon in Lahore and Layyah, Pakistan

> {{ site.fullName }} ({{ site.shortCredentials }}) is a plastic, cosmetic and reconstructive surgeon who sees patients in Lahore (Shadman) and Layyah, Punjab, Pakistan, and offers online video consultations for patients in other cities and overseas. He trained at Jinnah Burn & Reconstructive Surgery Centre, Lahore, and is a Life Member of the Pakistan Association of Plastic Surgeons (https://paps.org.pk/staff/muhammad-junaid-fateh/). His signature specialties are hair transplant (FUE, FUT, Sapphire FUE, DHI, beard and eyebrow), gynecomastia surgery, liposuction and body contouring, non-surgical aesthetics (Botox, fillers, PRP, skin treatments) and hand and reconstructive surgery.

